# `endOfLine: auto` in .prettierrc.json is not a preference. `.gitattributes`
# normalises line endings in the repository and checks them out native, so on a
# Windows clone every tracked file is CRLF and the default `lf` would fail the
# whole repo on a fresh checkout. This is the same trap scripts/check-rules.mjs
# documents at its `lines()` helper.

# Generated or vendored, and not ours to reformat.
pnpm-lock.yaml
src-tauri/gen/
src-tauri/target/
web/dist/
node_modules/

# The design system is authored by hand and its comments carry the reasoning
# that justifies each number. Prettier reflows those comments and reorders
# nothing useful, so tokens.css is left exactly as its author wrote it.
design/tokens.css

# Prose. Markdown wraps at a column the author chose per file, and reflowing it
# turns a one-word edit into a whole-paragraph diff.
*.md
